<title>UK: LIFFE coffee, cocoa end down on specs but sugar up.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee, cocoa end down on specs but sugar up.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Ends down, just above lows after NY speculators sell. July down $355 at $2,115.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Turns up, trade dominates. At 1620 GMT, Aug up 1.4 at 325.50.</p>
<p>COCOA - Ends down on speculative sales. July down 12 at 1,026.</p>
</text>
